{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>你是否總在手機裡塞滿好幾個益智遊戲，卻沒有一款能讓你長期堅持？《Word &amp; Logic: 迷你益智遊戲》將尋字、數獨、填字、密碼破解等十多種燒腦玩法濃縮成一個 App，每天提供免費的每日挑戰，讓你在 5 分鐘的空檔或通勤路上隨時鍛鍊大腦。今天這款集合型謎題中心正限時免費中，無論你是文字遊戲愛好者還是邏輯控，都能在這裡找到屬於自己的節奏。</p>\n\n<h2>10,000+ 關卡與 15 種語言支援</h2>\n<p>內建超過一萬道關卡，從經典數獨到創新的魔幻六邊形，每種模式都測試不同的思維能力。更棒的是，它支援 15 種以上語言，讓你用外語玩尋字遊戲、強化詞彙量，同時享受深色模式帶來的舒適觀看體驗，白天黑夜都不傷眼。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-12-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-13-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-14-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-15-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-16-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1260x2736bb-17-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Word &amp; Logic: 迷你益智遊戲</li>\n<li>應用類別：Games</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-05T14:43:07.206369+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":346,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}